  "appliesTo": "The term dates on this page apply to community primary, high and special schools, as well as community-maintained nurseries.",
  "academyNote": "Academies, foundation schools and voluntary aided schools set their own term dates, so these may be different from the dates listed here.",
  "localFacts": [
    {
      "fact": "Ealing's dates cover community primary, high and special schools and community-maintained nurseries; academies, foundation and voluntary aided schools set their own.",
      "source": "https://www.ealing.gov.uk/info/201123/your_child_at_school/119/term_and_holiday_dates/2"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Community schools have 198 days in total: each must choose 5 training days for teachers, decided by the headteacher with staff input.",
      "source": "https://www.ealing.gov.uk/info/201123/your_child_at_school/119/term_and_holiday_dates/2"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Each community school also sets 3 occasional holidays for pupils and staff in consultation with its governing body, so families should check the school website.",
      "source": "https://www.ealing.gov.uk/info/201123/your_child_at_school/119/term_and_holiday_dates/2"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The summer term runs to Tuesday 27 July 2027, and in 2027-28 to Wednesday 26 July 2028.",
      "source": "https://www.ealing.gov.uk/info/201123/your_child_at_school/119/term_and_holiday_dates/3"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The council states 195 working days for teachers and 190 for pupils each year.",
      "source": "https://www.ealing.gov.uk/info/201123/your_child_at_school/119/term_and_holiday_dates/2"
    }
